            },
            "description": "<p>Lists all the versions for the specified application, including versions that were rolled back. The response also includes a summary of the configuration associated with each version.</p> <p>To get the complete description of a specific application version, invoke the <a>DescribeApplicationVersion</a> operation.</p> <note> <p>This operation is supported only for Amazon Kinesis Data Analytics for Apache Flink.</p> </note>"
